REMARK   3  -R COMPLEXES WERE CREATED BASED ON THE ALPHAFOLD2 PREDICTIONS       
REMARK   3  FOR HLEP-R AND HLEPTIN, AND THE MOUSE 3:3 LEPTIN:LEP-RIGCRH2        
REMARK   3  COMPLEX (PDB 7Z3R) AND THE HUMAN LEPTIN:LEP-RCRH2 COMPLEX (PDB      
REMARK   3  7Z3Q) AND FITTED IN THE CRYO-EM MAPS VIA CHIMERA. ATOMIC MODELS     
REMARK   3  WERE FURTHER REFINED VIA REAL SPACE REFINEMENT IN PHENIX USING      
REMARK   3  RIGID BODY REFINEMENT AND COORDINATE REFINEMENT WITH REFERENCE      
REMARK   3  RESTRAINTS TO THE STARTING MODEL AND HYDROGEN-BONDING RESTRAINTS    
REMARK   3  ACROSS THE SITE II AND SITE III HLEPTIN:HLEP-R INTERFACE REGIONS.   
